# 24. Timeline

Every Space contains a Timeline.

The Timeline is generated automatically from user activity.

Users cannot manually create Timeline entries.

Timeline Events

* Space Created
* Artifact Created
* Artifact Updated
* Artifact Archived
* Goal Completed
* Media Uploaded
* Relationship Added
* Resource Saved
* Bug Resolved

Views

Chronological

Grouped by Day

Grouped by Week

Grouped by Month

Filtering

Artifact Type

Date

Tags

Author (Future)

Clicking any Timeline entry opens the corresponding Artifact.

